WEBVTT

1
00:00:01,870 --> 00:00:04,070
Shen Zi, I have enough to eat by myself

2
00:00:04,070 --> 00:00:07,140
These are from the mountains

3
00:00:07,140 --> 00:00:09,160
Shen Xi helped me before

4
00:00:09,160 --> 00:00:11,220
Now it's my turn to return the favor

5
00:00:11,220 --> 00:00:16,470
This is mountain medicine right

6
00:00:16,470 --> 00:00:18,470
People always say it’s good for wine shells

7
00:00:18,470 --> 00:00:19,670
Can moisturize the throat

8
00:00:19,670 --> 00:00:20,670
Shenzi try it

9
00:00:20,670 --> 00:00:22,670
It makes me feel good after drinking it. I’ll bring it next time

10
00:00:22,670 --> 00:00:28,840
This water is really useful

11
00:00:28,840 --> 00:00:31,010
As long as it's useful

12
00:00:31,010 --> 00:00:32,950
Keep this jar of water

13
00:00:32,950 --> 00:00:34,750
Don’t drink more than one bowl a day

14
00:00:34,750 --> 00:00:37,020
I'll send it to you after you drink it

15
00:00:37,020 --> 00:00:40,020
Use the flour to make some soft paste for Shenzi and Xiaoshan to eat.

16
00:00:40,020 --> 00:00:41,020
Don't save meat

17
00:00:41,220 --> 00:00:45,430
Health is important

18
00:00:45,430 --> 00:00:46,630
Take this back

19
00:00:46,630 --> 00:00:51,740
I’m really not short of food now, Brother Tian

20
00:00:51,740 --> 00:00:53,440
You will be fine in the future

21
00:00:53,440 --> 00:00:56,820
stronger than anything

22
00:00:56,820 --> 00:00:58,540
I will be fine

23
00:00:58,540 --> 00:00:59,640
You will be fine too
